// SHA-256's message schedule, the working variables' start and a round's
// first word as functions of its context (FIPS 180-4 §6.2.2 steps 1, 2
// and the T1 of step 3): the first of the three
// modules `sha256_compression.hthr` describes, which are three so that no
// one module's elaboration is all of them
// (issues/runtime-tests-cold-build-past-rail.md).
//
// What the `runtime` generator reads (issues/runtime-generator-imports.md).
import function_ir_lower;
import function_ir_lower_calls;
import nat_map;
import rt_held_loop;
